ciated with disease through a multidisciplinary approach. The organization focuses on implementing screening processes at various levels of healthcare to identify and address malnutrition effectively. Additionally, Alianza Másnutridos aims to raise awareness and integrate the issue of malnutrition into national and regional health strategies, ensuring that it is recognized as a critical component of public health initiatives.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL Y PARENTERAL:The \"Sociedad Española de Nutrición Enteral y Parenteral\" (SENPE) is a professional organization dedicated to the promotion and development of enteral and parenteral nutrition in Spain. It focuses on providing resources and support for clinical nutrition, particularly for patients with specific needs such as renal insufficiency and those undergoing hemodialysis. SENPE publishes guidelines and studies that address various aspects of nutritional support, including the administration and absorption of medications in patients receiving enteral nutrition. Through its efforts, SENPE aims to enhance the quality of nutritional care and ensure that healthcare professionals have access to the latest information and best practices in the field of enteral and parenteral nutrition.", "CONSEJO DE EUROPA:The Consejo de Europa is an international organization dedicated to promoting human rights, democracy, and the rule of law across Europe. In 2003, the Consejo de Europa issued recommendations specifically addressing the issue of hospital malnutrition, which included the establishment of guidelines aimed at guiding future actions in this critical area.", "HOLANDA:Holland has successfully implemented programs to combat malnutrition since 2007, aiming to gradually reduce its prevalence across all healthcare levels.", "NUTRITION DAY:Nutrition Day is an initiative organized by ESPEN that focuses on evaluating the nutrition of patients admitted to hospitals in order to assess the prevalence of malnutrition. This initiative aims to raise awareness and address the issue of malnutrition across Europe, highlighting its significance in healthcare settings.", "CONSEJO GENERAL DE ENFERMERÍA:The Consejo General de Enfermería is the governing body for nursing professionals in Spain, promoting nursing standards and practices.", "ALIANZA GENERAL DE PACIENTES:The Alianza General de Pacientes is an organization in Spain that represents patient interests and advocates for their rights in healthcare.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE MEDICINA DE FAMILIA Y COMUNITARIA:The Sociedad Española de Medicina de Familia y Comunitaria (semFYC) is a professional society for family medicine practitioners in Spain.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE MÉDICOS DE ATENCIÓN PRIMARIA:The Sociedad Española de Médicos de Atención Primaria (SEMERGEN) is an organization focused on the interests and education of primary care physicians in Spain.", "SOCIEDAD ESPAÑOLA DE GASTROENTEROLOGÍA, HEPATOLOGÍA Y NUTRICIÓN PEDIÁTRICA:The Sociedad Española de Gastroenterología, Hepatología y Nutrición Pediátrica (SGHNP) is a professional society dedicated to pediatric gastroenterology and nutrition in Spain."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}